==Trivia==
*The symbols in the middle of the Mysterious Calamity look like the Roman numeral XI (11), referring to how it was created for the 11th and 1/2 anniversary event for the Japanese version.
*The Mysterious Calamity's design appears to be a combination of [[The Cat God]]'s bodiless "idle state" and [[King Doge]]'s red hair.
*Although Mysterious Calamity and [[Ensanglion the Calamity]] are both powerful [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] event enemies with "Calamity" in their name, Omni Strike, Weaken and Immune to Freeze, this may be a coincidence, as their Japanese names use different words for "calamity" (Mystery Calamity's uses 厄災 ''yakusai'', Ensanglion's uses 禍 ''ka'').
*It has the highest money drop in the game.

